OL,3,GNEWSARapist thought he was 'immune from
OL,4,Aconsequences'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after admitting
OL,7,Fto the rape and coercive control of a
OL,8,Fwoman in Stafford.
OL,10,FKamljit Sahota, 48, initially denied
OL,11,Fthe offences but changed his plea after
OL,12,Fevidence from the woman was presented
OL,13,Fin court.
OL,15,FStaffordshire Police said the offences
OL,16,Ftook place between July and October
OL,17,F2025, with the rapist believing he
OL,18,Fwould be "immune from the
OL,19,Fconsequences".
